    "text": "UML class diagram of the AI profile. AIPackage specialises Software/Package, making releaseTime, suppliedBy, downloadLocation, packageVersion and primaryPurpose mandatory, and adds autonomyType, domain, energyConsumption, hyperparameter, informationAboutApplication, informationAboutTraining, limitation, metric, metricDecisionThreshold, modelDataPreprocessing, modelExplainability, safetyRiskAssessment, standardCompliance, typeOfModel and useSensitivePersonalInformation. EnergyConsumption groups finetuning, inference and training EnergyConsumptionDescription entries (energyQuantity, energyUnit). Enumerations: EnergyUnitType, SafetyRiskAssessmentType.",
